      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eTo enter the equation, you first have to get 0 on one side. Subtract 75357 from both sides.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eKey in \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17578\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q9.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17579\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17580\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17581\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17582\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q9.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17583\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qx73.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17583\u0026quot;,263)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17584\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qminus.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_17584\u0026quot;,185)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17585\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q7.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17586\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17587\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q3.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17588\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_17589\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q7.gif\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_4_1_solvingequations_2_30/f-30-2-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
